      <div class="letter-wrap">
        <div class="letter-date">// date_17 · opened at last ♡</div>
        <div class="letter-body">
          <p>I know this is the last file you opened. Good. That means you went through everything else first — the bugs, the drafts, the settings panel. I hope you smiled. I hope somewhere in the middle of the funny parts, something landed differently than expected.</p>
          <p>I want to say something that I think is actually hard to say — not because it's complicated, but because it's <span class="highlight">very simple, and simple things can feel the most exposing</span>.</p>
          <p>I see you. Not in a grand, dramatic way. Just — I notice. I notice the way you hold things in because you need to be the one to process them on your own. I notice the way you're funny right when something is getting too real, like a little redirect. I notice that you feel deeply and just don't broadcast it. And <span class="highlight">I think that's one of the most honest things about you.</span></p>
          <p>I don't need you to change any of that. I'm not waiting for a version of you that's louder about her feelings or easier to read. I like the version that takes her time. The version that says "I'm fine" and means "I'm working on it." The version that shows up — quietly, imperfectly, <span class="highlight2">consistently.</span></p>
          <p>Iris is our song because I think you understand it in a way most people don't. That line — "I don't want the world to see me, 'cause I don't think that they'd understand." You've lived inside that feeling. And still, <span class="highlight">you let me in a little at a time</span>, which is actually the braver thing.</p>
          <p>17 dates. And every single one, I leave wanting more of exactly this. Not a different version. This one.</p>
          <p>Happy 17th. You don't have to say anything big back. You never do. <span class="highlight2">Just being here is enough. It always has been.</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="letter-sign">with everything I have, <span>— me ♡</span></div>
        <div class="letter-ps">
          // ps. yes I made a whole fake operating system for you.<br>
          // yes that is normal. no I will not be taking questions.<br>
          // pps. you're my favorite person.
        </div>
      </div>
    
